lay: flex; gap: .4rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: .9rem; }\n    .fx .chip { display: inline-flex; gap: .3rem; align-items: center; padding: .22rem .6rem; border-radius: 99px;\n      background: #1e2740; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: .76rem; }\n    .fx h3 { margin: 0 0 .3rem; font-size: .96rem; }\n    .fx p { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #8b93a7; font-size: .83rem; }\n    .fx button { padding: .45rem 1.1rem; border: 1px solid #2b3450; border-radius: 9px; background: transparent;\n      color: #cbd5e1; font: inherit; font-size: .82rem; cursor: pointer; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"fx\" role=\"status\"><div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">webgl ×</span><span class=\"chip\">1990s ×</span><span class=\"chip\">beginner ×</span></div>\n  <h3>No specimens match all three filters</h3><p>Nothing in the catalogue uses WebGL from the 1990s.</p>\n  <button type=\"button\">Clear all filters</button></div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
